      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "概念伪代码：显式调度 main / softmax / correction",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "概念伪代码：显式调度 main / softmax / correction",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pseudo-code",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 645,
      "y": 205,
      "width": 363.0000000000002,
      "height": 468.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a8a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 8163,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "for q_tile i:\n  init m,l,acc in registers/TMEM\n  prefetch Q,K,V stages\n\n  for k_tile j in pipelined order:\n    launch async MMA: S_j = Q @ K_j.T\n    while MMA runs:\n      schedule softmax for previous S\n      maybe skip rescale if max change small\n\n    softmax stage:\n      m_new = max(m, rowmax(S_j))\n      if need_rescale(m, m_new):\n        acc *= exp_approx(m - m_new)\n        l *= exp_approx(m - m_new)\n      P = exp_approx(S_j - m_new)\n\n    launch async MMA: acc += P @ V_j\n    keep intermediates in TMEM when possible\n\n  final normalize O = acc / l\n\nbackward idea:\n  2-CTA MMA cooperates on larger tile\n  reduce SMEM traffic and dQ atomics",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "for q_tile i:\n  init m,l,acc in registers/TMEM\n  prefetch Q,K,V stages\n\n  for k_tile j in pipelined order:\n    launch async MMA: S_j = Q @ K_j.T\n    while MMA runs:\n      schedule softmax for previous S\n      maybe skip rescale if max change small\n\n    softmax stage:\n      m_new = max(m, rowmax(S_j))\n      if need_rescale(m, m_new):\n        acc *= exp_approx(m - m_new)\n        l *= exp_approx(m - m_new)\n      P = exp_approx(S_j - m_new)\n\n    launch async MMA: acc += P @ V_j\n    keep intermediates in TMEM when possible\n\n  final normalize O = acc / l\n\nbackward idea:\n  2-CTA MMA cooperates on larger tile\n  reduce SMEM traffic and dQ atomics",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
