    {
      "id": "pipeline-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 95,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 1139.8499999999992,
      "height": 42.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 8177,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "讲解重点：v4 不只是 tile 更大。Blackwell 上 MMA、load 更异步，TMEM 靠近 Tensor Core 存中间结果；这样避免很多中间量反复进出 SMEM。\n软 softmax 的意义：exp 和 rescale 变成瓶颈后，用近似/软件化分担特殊函数单元压力；条件 rescale 则跳过不必要的旧 acc/l 重缩放。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "讲解重点：v4 不只是 tile 更大。Blackwell 上 MMA、load 更异步，TMEM 靠近 Tensor Core 存中间结果；这样避免很多中间量反复进出 SMEM。\n软 softmax 的意义：exp 和 rescale 变成瓶颈后，用近似/软件化分担特殊函数单元压力；条件 rescale 则跳过不必要的旧 acc/l 重缩放。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
