      "text": "从 v3 到 v4 的面试对比句",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "从 v3 到 v4 的面试对比句",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "compare-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 85,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 1522.7999999999984,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#78350f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "seed": 8201,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "v3 的关键词是 Hopper 异步化：TMA/WGMMA + warp specialization，解决搬运和计算重叠。\nv4 的关键词是 Blackwell 非对称瓶颈：Tensor Core 太快后，softmax、SMEM、原子累加和调度成为主要问题，所以要 TMEM、更深 pipeline、软件 exp、条件 rescale、2-CTA MMA。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "v3 的关键词是 Hopper 异步化：TMA/WGMMA + warp specialization，解决搬运和计算重叠。\nv4 的关键词是 Blackwell 非对称瓶颈：Tensor Core 太快后，softmax、SMEM、原子累加和调度成为主要问题，所以要 TMEM、更深 pipeline、软件 exp、条件 rescale、2-CTA MMA。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
